        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="noteAwaiting" value="Overdue does NOT auto-close: EndDate already shifted when the renewal fee was paid — the addendum is paperwork only, it does not hold the unit. Bell reminder before the 7-day deadline (SignatureDueDate).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;EXPIRED — customer never signs: staff closes the file after reminders are exhausted (manual, no auto-cut — a late customer can still sign normally).&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;VOIDED — staff voids deliberately: drafted wrong (re-issue = a NEW row on the same extension — extension 1—N addendum) or customer checks out early before the deadline." style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;darkOpacity=0.05;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=8;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="140" y="560" width="780" height="180" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
